<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00459> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio_adelphi> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Batteva puro via Veneto, via Ludovisi, ogni tanto, ch’è ’n po’ più scura, pe’ via de le donne. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 182"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00460> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio_adelphi> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Batteva puro via Veneto, via Ludovisi, ogni tanto, ch’è ’n po’ più scura, pe’ via de le donne. »"@it ;
