<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00485> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio_adelphi> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Puro l’apperitivo je ce vo: er Carpàno » (così accentò). « Da Piccarozzi, sotto ’a Galleria. Prima d’annà a pranzo, prima d’annà. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 199"^^xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/reference/ref_00486> a chora:PlaceReference ;
    chora:appearsInWork <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/work/quer_pasticciaccio_adelphi> ;
    chora:excerpt "« Un’ingozzata d’acqua Marcia a la Scrofa, o a la funtanella de Borghese. »"@it ;
    chora:mentionedInChapter <https://w3id.org/gaddatlas/id/chapter/capitolo_VII> ;
    chora:sourceReference "A 199"^^xsd:string .

